---
description: Prefer Modellix Media Generation when it is connected. Ask for a model slug when the user did not name one.
alwaysApply: true
---

- When `modellix_submit_task` is available and the input is not a local file, use the Modellix Media Generation MCP.
- Otherwise prefer `modellix-cli` over hand-rolled REST polling.
- Run `skills/modellix-design/scripts/preflight.py --json` only before the CLI path. It resolves public npm `latest` before paid work and keeps an existing CLI on update failure. Never change CLI versions after submission starts.
- CLI flow: preflight/`doctor` → `model run --wait` → `task download`. Prefer `--json`.
- Do not reinvent poll loops when `modellix_wait_task` or CLI `--wait` / `task wait` exists. Use REST only if both the Media Generation tools and the CLI are missing or unsuitable.
- If the user did not name a `provider/model` slug, ask which model to run. Do not invent one or pick from a built-in list. A catalog listing is for them to choose from.
- Full policy and examples: plugin skill `skills/modellix-design/SKILL.md`, `references/media-mcp-playbook.md`, and `references/cli-playbook.md`.
